# UI rules — {{ project_name }}

## Architecture
- One component, one job; colocate related logic
- Server/client split: `'use client'` only when interactivity requires it
- Prefer existing design tokens and component primitives

## Styling
- Use {{ stack.styling }} consistently — no ad-hoc inline styles
- Mobile-first responsive layouts
- Every interactive element needs hover, focus, disabled, and loading states

## Accessibility
- Semantic HTML first; ARIA only when needed
- Visible focus rings; keyboard navigation must work
- WCAG AA contrast minimum for text

## Before shipping UI
- Check layout at mobile and desktop widths
- Confirm no new console errors
- Run `{{ commands.lint }}` if configured
